# Fetched third-party plugins land here (`npx tsx scripts/plugin-fetch.mjs <git-url>`).
#
# NOT gitignored, on purpose: once a plugin is reviewed and added to the roster
# the site BUILDS from it, so its code must be in the repo. Hiding it would mean
# shipping code that is not committed. Review first
# (`task bench:plugin-validate -- <dir>`), then commit, then roster.
